       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.    NWC620.
       AUTHOR.        P. GONZALES.
       INSTALLATION.  NORTHWIND TRADERS - DALLAS DIVISION.
       DATE-WRITTEN.  07/30/91.
      *****************************************************************
      *  PRINT ONE INVOICE  (CALLED FROM NWC620C)
      *
      *  07/30/91 PG         NEW
      *  09/30/95 PG   PG95  MOVED TO NORTHWIND FILES
      *  01/20/00 AW   AW00  Y2K - DATES ON FILE ARE CYYMMDD
      *
      *  PARM: ORDER NUMBER PACKED 7,0
      *  QSYSPRT IS OVERRIDDEN BY NWC620C (FORM TYPE INVOICE)
      *  TOTAL DUE = ORDER TOTAL + FREIGHT
      *****************************************************************
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-AS400.
       OBJECT-COMPUTER. IBM-AS400.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT PRTFILE ASSIGN TO PRINTER-QSYSPRT
               FILE STATUS IS WS-PRT-STAT.
           SELECT ORDHDR ASSIGN TO DATABASE-ORDHDR
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
               ACCESS MODE IS RANDOM
               RECORD KEY IS OH-KEY
               FILE STATUS IS WS-ORDHDR-STAT.
           SELECT ORDDTL ASSIGN TO DATABASE-ORDDTL
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
               ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS OD-KEY
               FILE STATUS IS WS-ORDDTL-STAT.
           SELECT CUSMST ASSIGN TO DATABASE-CUSMST
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
               ACCESS MODE IS RANDOM
               RECORD KEY IS CM-KEY
               FILE STATUS IS WS-CUSMST-STAT.
           SELECT PRDMST ASSIGN TO DATABASE-PRDMST
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
               ACCESS MODE IS RANDOM
               RECORD KEY IS PM-KEY
               FILE STATUS IS WS-PRDMST-STAT.
           SELECT CODTBL ASSIGN TO DATABASE-CODTBL
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
               ACCESS MODE IS RANDOM
               RECORD KEY IS CT-KEY
               FILE STATUS IS WS-CODTBL-STAT.
       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD  PRTFILE
           LABEL RECORDS ARE OMITTED.
       01  PRT-REC                     PIC X(132).
       FD  ORDHDR
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
           COPY ORDHDRCP.
       FD  ORDDTL
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
           COPY ORDDTLCP.
       FD  CUSMST
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
           COPY CUSMSTCP.
       FD  PRDMST
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
           COPY PRDMSTCP.
       FD  CODTBL
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
           COPY CODTBLCP.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       77  WS-PRT-STAT                 PIC XX    VALUE SPACES.
       77  WS-ORDHDR-STAT              PIC XX    VALUE SPACES.
       77  WS-ORDDTL-STAT              PIC XX    VALUE SPACES.
       77  WS-CUSMST-STAT              PIC XX    VALUE SPACES.
       77  WS-PRDMST-STAT              PIC XX    VALUE SPACES.
       77  WS-CODTBL-STAT              PIC XX    VALUE SPACES.
       77  WS-LINE-CNT                 PIC 99    VALUE 99.
       77  WS-PAGE                     PIC 999   VALUE ZERO.
       77  WS-ITEMS                    PIC S9(9)V99 VALUE ZERO.
       77  WS-DUE                      PIC S9(9)V99 VALUE ZERO.
       77  WS-DISC-PCT                 PIC 999   VALUE ZERO.
      *  DATE CONVERSION WORK FIELDS (COPIED FROM NWC610)
       77  WS-CYMD                     PIC 9(7)  VALUE ZERO.
       77  WS-CYY                      PIC 999   VALUE ZERO.
       77  WS-CC                       PIC 9     VALUE ZERO.
       77  WS-YY                       PIC 99    VALUE ZERO.
       77  WS-MMDD                     PIC 9(4)  VALUE ZERO.
       77  WS-MDY6                     PIC 9(6)  VALUE ZERO.
       01  WS-TODAY                    PIC 9(6)  VALUE ZERO.
       01  WS-TODAY-R REDEFINES WS-TODAY.
           05  WS-T-YY                 PIC 99.
           05  WS-T-MM                 PIC 99.
           05  WS-T-DD                 PIC 99.
      *  PRINT LINES
       01  HD1.
           05  FILLER                  PIC X(40) VALUE
               "NORTHWIND TRADERS - DALLAS".
           05  FILLER                  PIC X(60) VALUE SPACES.
           05  FILLER                  PIC X(8)  VALUE "INVOICE".
           05  FILLER                  PIC X(9)  VALUE "  PAGE ".
           05  HD1-PAGE                PIC ZZ9.
       01  HD2.
           05  FILLER                  PIC X(40) VALUE
               "2101 COMMERCE ST.  DALLAS TX 75201".
           05  FILLER                  PIC X(60) VALUE SPACES.
           05  FILLER                  PIC X(6)  VALUE "DATE ".
           05  HD2-DATE                PIC 99/99/99.
       01  HD3.
           05  FILLER                  PIC X(10) VALUE "ORDER NO.".
           05  HD3-ORD                 PIC Z(6)9.
           05  FILLER                  PIC X(5)  VALUE SPACES.
           05  FILLER                  PIC X(10) VALUE "ORDERED".
           05  HD3-ODAT                PIC 99/99/99.
           05  FILLER                  PIC X(5)  VALUE SPACES.
           05  FILLER                  PIC X(10) VALUE "SHIP VIA".
           05  HD3-SHPV                PIC X(30).
       01  HD4.
           05  FILLER                  PIC X(10) VALUE "SOLD TO".
           05  HD4-CUST                PIC X(6).
           05  HD4-NAME                PIC X(40).
           05  FILLER                  PIC X(4)  VALUE SPACES.
           05  FILLER                  PIC X(10) VALUE "SHIP TO".
           05  HD4-SNAM                PIC X(40).
       01  HD5.
           05  FILLER                  PIC X(16) VALUE SPACES.
           05  HD5-ADDR                PIC X(40).
           05  FILLER                  PIC X(14) VALUE SPACES.
           05  HD5-SADR                PIC X(40).
       01  HD6.
           05  FILLER                  PIC X(16) VALUE SPACES.
           05  HD6-CITY                PIC X(15).
           05  FILLER                  PIC X     VALUE SPACE.
           05  HD6-CNTY                PIC X(24).
           05  FILLER                  PIC X(14) VALUE SPACES.
           05  HD6-SCTY                PIC X(15).
           05  FILLER                  PIC X     VALUE SPACE.
           05  HD6-SCNT                PIC X(15).
       01  HD7.
           05  FILLER                  PIC X(50) VALUE
               "LN  PROD#  DESCRIPTION                          ".
           05  FILLER                  PIC X(50) VALUE
               "    QTY     UNIT PRICE  DISC      EXTENDED".
       01  DL1.
           05  DL1-LIN                 PIC ZZ9.
           05  FILLER                  PIC X     VALUE SPACE.
           05  DL1-PRD                 PIC ZZZZ9.
           05  FILLER                  PIC XX    VALUE SPACES.
           05  DL1-NAME                PIC X(40).
           05  FILLER                  PIC X     VALUE SPACE.
           05  DL1-QTY                 PIC ZZ,ZZ9.
           05  FILLER                  PIC XX    VALUE SPACES.
           05  DL1-PRIC                PIC Z,ZZZ,ZZ9.99.
           05  FILLER                  PIC XX    VALUE SPACES.
           05  DL1-DISC                PIC ZZ9.
           05  FILLER                  PIC X     VALUE "%".
           05  FILLER                  PIC X     VALUE SPACE.
           05  DL1-EXT                 PIC ZZZ,ZZZ,ZZ9.99-.
       01  TL1.
           05  FILLER                  PIC X(64) VALUE SPACES.
           05  TL1-TEXT                PIC X(15).
           05  TL1-AMT                 PIC ZZZ,ZZZ,ZZ9.99-.
       LINKAGE SECTION.
       01  LK-ORD-NO                   PIC S9(7) COMP-3.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION USING LK-ORD-NO.
       0000-MAINLINE.
           OPEN OUTPUT PRTFILE.
           OPEN INPUT ORDHDR ORDDTL CUSMST PRDMST CODTBL.
           MOVE 99 TO WS-LINE-CNT.
           MOVE ZERO TO WS-PAGE WS-ITEMS.
           ACCEPT WS-TODAY FROM DATE.
           COMPUTE WS-MDY6 = WS-T-MM * 10000 + WS-T-DD * 100 + WS-T-YY.
           MOVE WS-MDY6 TO HD2-DATE.
           MOVE LK-ORD-NO TO OH-ORD-NO.
           READ ORDHDR INVALID KEY GO TO 9000-END-PGM.
           MOVE OH-CUST TO CM-CUST.
           READ CUSMST INVALID KEY
               MOVE SPACES TO CUSMST-REC
               MOVE "*** CUSTOMER NOT ON FILE ***" TO CM-NAME.
           MOVE "SHP" TO CT-TYPE.
           MOVE OH-SHPV TO CT-CODE.
           READ CODTBL INVALID KEY MOVE SPACES TO CT-DESC.
           MOVE OH-ORD-NO TO OD-ORD-NO.
           MOVE ZERO TO OD-LIN-NO.
           START ORDDTL KEY IS NOT LESS THAN OD-KEY
               INVALID KEY GO TO 0500-TOTALS.
       0100-READ.
           READ ORDDTL NEXT RECORD AT END GO TO 0500-TOTALS.
           IF OD-ORD-NO NOT = OH-ORD-NO GO TO 0500-TOTALS.
           IF WS-LINE-CNT > 55
               PERFORM 1000-HEADINGS THRU 1000-EXIT.
           MOVE OD-PRD-NO TO PM-PRD-NO.
           READ PRDMST INVALID KEY MOVE "*NOT ON FILE" TO PM-NAME.
           MOVE OD-LIN-NO TO DL1-LIN.
           MOVE OD-PRD-NO TO DL1-PRD.
           MOVE PM-NAME TO DL1-NAME.
           MOVE OD-QTY TO DL1-QTY.
           MOVE OD-PRIC TO DL1-PRIC.
           COMPUTE WS-DISC-PCT = OD-DISC * 100.
           MOVE WS-DISC-PCT TO DL1-DISC.
      *  EXTENDED PRICE AS STORED ON THE LINE (NWC610 WORKS IT OUT)
           MOVE OD-EXT TO DL1-EXT.
           ADD OD-EXT TO WS-ITEMS.
           WRITE PRT-REC FROM DL1 AFTER ADVANCING 1 LINE.
           ADD 1 TO WS-LINE-CNT.
           GO TO 0100-READ.
       0500-TOTALS.
           IF WS-LINE-CNT > 50
               PERFORM 1000-HEADINGS THRU 1000-EXIT.
           MOVE "ITEMS" TO TL1-TEXT.
           MOVE WS-ITEMS TO TL1-AMT.
           WRITE PRT-REC FROM TL1 AFTER ADVANCING 2 LINES.
           MOVE "FREIGHT" TO TL1-TEXT.
           MOVE OH-FRT TO TL1-AMT.
           WRITE PRT-REC FROM TL1 AFTER ADVANCING 1 LINE.
      *  1991 RULE: ORDER TOTAL IS ITEMS ONLY, SO ADD THE FREIGHT
           COMPUTE WS-DUE = OH-TOTL + OH-FRT.
           MOVE "TOTAL DUE" TO TL1-TEXT.
           MOVE WS-DUE TO TL1-AMT.
           WRITE PRT-REC FROM TL1 AFTER ADVANCING 2 LINES.
       9000-END-PGM.
           CLOSE PRTFILE ORDHDR ORDDTL CUSMST PRDMST CODTBL.
           GOBACK.
      *---------------------------------------------------------------
      *  1000 - PAGE HEADINGS (THE WHOLE HEADER IS REPEATED EACH PAGE)
      *---------------------------------------------------------------
       1000-HEADINGS.
           ADD 1 TO WS-PAGE.
           MOVE WS-PAGE TO HD1-PAGE.
           WRITE PRT-REC FROM HD1 AFTER ADVANCING PAGE.
           WRITE PRT-REC FROM HD2 AFTER ADVANCING 1 LINE.
           MOVE OH-ORD-NO TO HD3-ORD.
           MOVE OH-ODAT TO WS-CYMD.
           PERFORM 7000-CYMD-TO-MDY THRU 7000-EXIT.
           MOVE WS-MDY6 TO HD3-ODAT.
           MOVE CT-DESC TO HD3-SHPV.
           WRITE PRT-REC FROM HD3 AFTER ADVANCING 2 LINES.
           MOVE OH-CUST TO HD4-CUST.
           MOVE CM-NAME TO HD4-NAME.
           MOVE OH-SNAM TO HD4-SNAM.
           WRITE PRT-REC FROM HD4 AFTER ADVANCING 2 LINES.
           MOVE CM-ADDR TO HD5-ADDR.
           MOVE OH-SADR TO HD5-SADR.
           WRITE PRT-REC FROM HD5 AFTER ADVANCING 1 LINE.
           MOVE CM-CITY TO HD6-CITY.
           MOVE CM-CNTY TO HD6-CNTY.
           MOVE OH-SCTY TO HD6-SCTY.
           MOVE OH-SCNT TO HD6-SCNT.
           WRITE PRT-REC FROM HD6 AFTER ADVANCING 1 LINE.
           WRITE PRT-REC FROM HD7 AFTER ADVANCING 2 LINES.
           MOVE 11 TO WS-LINE-CNT.
       1000-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *---------------------------------------------------------------
      *  7000 - CYYMMDD TO MMDDYY (COPIED FROM NWC610)
      *---------------------------------------------------------------
       7000-CYMD-TO-MDY.
           MOVE ZERO TO WS-MDY6.
           IF WS-CYMD = ZERO GO TO 7000-EXIT.
           DIVIDE WS-CYMD BY 10000 GIVING WS-CYY REMAINDER WS-MMDD.
           DIVIDE WS-CYY BY 100 GIVING WS-CC REMAINDER WS-YY.
           COMPUTE WS-MDY6 = WS-MMDD * 100 + WS-YY.
       7000-EXIT.
           EXIT.
